<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109583" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποχόνδρ-ιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χόνδρος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>under the cartilage of the breastbone,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάθη ὑ.</span> ailments <i>in that part,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				953b25
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποχόνδριον, τό,</span> in sg. and pl., <i>the soft part</i> or
				<i>parts of the body below the cartilage and above the navel,
				abdomen,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ δεξιὸν ὑ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Aph.</u>
					4.64
				</span></i>
			, al., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				493a20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Od.</u>
				59(61)
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.93
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.56
			</span></i>, al.</div>
